# The two secret files of the public staging instance (plan 03-09). .env.staging carries
# the HaRP shared key, the administrator password and the account passwords of the
# throwaway users; .env.staging.app carries the registration secret and two working app
# passwords. Both are generated on the staging host and never belong in this repository.
.env.staging
.env.staging.app
# The connection file of the throwaway measurement topology of phase 17
# (compose.spike-opendesk.yml). It carries the HaRP shared key, the registration secret, two
# working app passwords and, from plan 17-03 on, the OAuth client secrets of the two access
# ways to OpenProject. .env.spike-opendesk.example names the variables and carries no value.
.env.spike-opendesk
.harp-certs/
# The FRP certificate material of the phase 17 topology. Its own directory, so the two HaRP
# daemons of this repository cannot regenerate a shared CA under each other.
.harp-certs-spike-od/
